        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"inspect-the-numerator\">Inspect the numerator</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The Feynman rules return a <code>TensorExpression</code>. First project the external\ncolor indices with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta^{ab}/8||)</marimo-tex> and contract all color tensors. Keep\nthe resulting scalar as a global factor <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(C_{\\rm color}||)</marimo-tex> throughout.\nThe remaining expressions contain only Lorentz and Dirac tensors, with\nLorentz slots continued to symbolic <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D||)</marimo-tex> before contraction.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ecfG",
      "code_hash": "3b2d792476b88fd7aafd34c564474f0b",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
