    },
    {
      "id": "urSm",
      "code_hash": "89d2f648244cd32c8d79164b8c3ce90a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The same massive expansion is available directly on a diagram. It retains\nevery UV-divergent order automatically and returns the additive local\ncounterterm in edge momenta with tagged <code>denom</code> propagators. Diagram-wide\nweights and Lorentz projectors remain separate. Pass <code>numerator=</code> for a prepared\nnumerator, or call <code>diagram.filter(...).uv_counterterm(mUV)</code> to expand a selected region.\nThis is a single UV limit, before forest subtraction and pole integration.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jxvo",
      "code_hash": "f161f7c0c3cf649812f81922f072c680",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "mWxS",
      "code_hash": "eb747a9e1cf56b993d160642adb85e32",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "CcZR",
      "code_hash": "431684e30280d79f740440bc867f2ade",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "YWSi",
      "code_hash": "57fc125aa4b385eb11fa2e4a1b63411d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"tensor-reduce-the-uv-expansion\">Tensor-reduce the UV expansion</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each expanded denominator depends only on <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k^2||)</marimo-tex>.\n<code>diagram.tensor_reduce(D, expression=uv_routed_series)</code> identifies the\ninternal momentum from the graph and keeps <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(p||)</marimo-tex> external.\n<code>uv_tensor_input</code> names <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k||)</marimo-tex> with its graph edge while retaining\ncompact dot products. FeynKit reduces the mixed powers <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((k\\cdot p)^n||)</marimo-tex>\ndirectly, including the vanishing odd-rank terms.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "zlud",
      "code_hash": "130173c304f640a05464eabd9aa181a0",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tZnO",
      "code_hash": "7b9ff6a955445bfbb7fba557af385a2f",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "xvXZ",
      "code_hash": "a0de5883d56392e87a04d89bac5c92c8",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "CLip",
      "code_hash": "aea00b05fc32c3a91180537aaab22cf4",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"uv-counterterm\">UV counterterm</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The UV expansion already has massive denominators\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((k^2-m_{\\rm UV}^2)^n||)</marimo-tex>. Tensor-reduce the series, set <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(t=1||)</marimo-tex>, and negate it\nto obtain the angular-averaged counterterm. No mass is inserted afterward.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The integrated pole is determined by the coefficient of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1/(k^2)^2||)</marimo-tex>\nin its large-<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k||)</marimo-tex> radial expansion. With <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D=4-2\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex> and measure\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d^Dk/(2\\pi)^D||)</marimo-tex>, multiply that coefficient by <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i/(16\\pi^2\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>.\nThe auxiliary <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m_{\\rm UV}||)</marimo-tex> cancels from this coefficient. Restore\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(C_{\\rm color}||)</marimo-tex> once, when assembling the integrated counterterm below.\nFinite parts are not evaluated.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "YECM",
      "code_hash": "af23c24ed042e12bcbfeb673b97c6e3f",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
